<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Automatic Scooter Daily Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>Automatic scooter daily rental in Hanoi is priced across two verified tiers: the entry automatics at 150,000 VND per day and the step-up machines at 200,000 VND per day. This guide plans a day on an automatic around those numbers: which machines sit in which tier, what the daily rate buys, how the break-even with weekly rates works, and what to confirm before riding away.</p>
<p>We cover the verified prices tier by tier, what automatic means on this fleet, the choice between the two daily rates, honest daily budget planning, and the questions that settle a booking in minutes. Every verified rate is listed in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, the full model range with photos and details is in the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a> covers the questions renters ask most.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">the two verified daily tiers</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">what an automatic scooter is</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">choosing between the two daily rates</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">the daily break-even math</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">planning a daily budget</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">automatics for a day of city riding</a></li>
